<sect1 id="UdpDelaySimRunner_8h_1DESCRIPTION">
<title>DESCRIPTION</title>
<para>This <ref refid="classRouter" kindref="compound">Router</ref> class is a process which sends LINKUP or LINKDOWN events to Ingress and Storage modules to determine if a given bundle should be forwarded immediately to Egress or should be stored. To determine a given link availability, i.e. when a contact to a particular neighbor node exists, the router reads a contact plan which is a JSON file that defines all the connections between all the nodes in the network. </para>
</sect1>
